            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Adds release notes for the new \"Element-specific pseudo-classes\" section</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Bugzilla: <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2014442\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2014442</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Project <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4127808004\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43561\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43561/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43561\">#43561</a></li>\n</ul>",
