        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Made the values section better follow <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/MDN/Writing_guidelines/Page_structures/Page_types/CSS_property_page_template#values\" rel=\"nofollow\">MDN values section template</a>.  Explained HDR at first occurrence.<br>\nMade dynamic range look more like it ws being defined. Clarified descriptions of the 'dynamic-range-limit' property values and improved the overall explanation of dynamic range in the context of HDR and SDR.<br>\nmade see also a list</p>",
